      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">How to run a local inter-club badminton league</h1>
      <p class="lede">Running a league is mostly organisation: divisions, fixtures, results and a table everyone trusts. This is the secretary's guide, from getting clubs on board to promotion and relegation at the end of the season.</p>
