      </div>

      <p>For the club-side of this, our guide on <a href="/guides/picking-league-teams-club-data">picking balanced league teams from your club-night data</a> goes deeper, and <a href="/guides/badminton-club-rating-systems">how club rating systems work</a> explains the ratings behind it.</p>

